 6. **Clustering and pre-check (telemetry and flagging only).** Run `superclaude review cluster <output>/panel/cards --snapshot <output>/artifacts/input-snapshot.yaml --out <output>` and `superclaude review verify-citations --cards <output>/panel/cards --snapshot <output>/artifacts/input-snapshot.yaml --root <repo root> --out <output>`. Neither drops anything and neither feeds the debate. Every citation the pre-check flags joins the evidence-validator re-read set even when its sampling would have skipped it; the validator alone decides drops, and `citations_dropped` keeps its sample-count meaning. Record `cluster_agreement` (never compared with the convergence thresholds, never routes anything). Advance `clustered`.
